    <div class="about-body">
      <h1 class="reveal">About</h1>
      <div class="prose reveal">
        <p>
          Hi, I'm Ismael. I'm an ML researcher and engineer based in Montreal. My work spans both ends of the compute spectrum: efficient models on constrained edge hardware and training at scale.
        </p>
        <p>
          I write about things I find interesting: spiking neural networks, edge inference, machine learning, and data science. The blog is where I think out loud.
        </p>
        <p>
          Feel free to reach out via my <a href="mailto:ecology-dad-cyclic@duck.com">current alias email</a>.
        </p>
